{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>El</b> — The word of HaShem to the prophet: \"Set to your mouth a shofar; let [him] swoop like an eagle upon the house of YHWH.\" Yefet said: \"Set to your mouth a shofar, for an enemy will swoop like an eagle upon the house of YHWH.\" Yefet interpreted well, on account of the word יען."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:32.846671381Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}